# There is nothing vendored any more -- llama.cpp was the only entry and it
# went with the language model (docs/decisions-d20.md). The rule stays because
# if a third-party tree ever lands here again it is still not ours to carry.
vendor/
# Likewise the model weights. Kept so that a stray .gguf cannot be committed
# by accident; game/models/README.md says what was there and why it is not.
game/models/*.gguf
!game/models/README.md
build/

# The Godot engine binary: a 138 MB tool you download, not source we wrote.
# GitHub refuses anything over 100 MB, and it does not belong in history.
Godot_v*_linux.x86_64
Godot_v*
